    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.title", "value": "报告错误" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.description", "value": "提交错误报告。填写详细信息，然后“在 GitHub 上打开”会在浏览器中启动预填的错误表单，或“发送到服务器”会像崩溃报告一样将其上传到已连接的 Basis 服务器。标有 * 的字段为必填项。" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.enable", "value": "启用错误报告" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.enable.tooltip", "value": "显示错误报告表单。提交时会自动附上构建信息和近期日志。" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.summary", "value": "标题" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.summary.tooltip", "value": "对错误的简短描述性概括。将成为 GitHub 问题标题。" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.describe", "value": "描述该错误？ *" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.describe.tooltip", "value": "清楚地详述实际发生的情况。" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.repro", "value": "重现步骤 *" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.repro.tooltip", "value": "重现该行为所需的步骤。" },
    { "key": "settings.developer.bugReport.expected", "value": "预期行为 *" },
